msgid ""
"Indicates if the Kubernetes cluster managed by Quarkus Dev Services is shared. When shared, Quarkus looks for running containers using label-based service discovery. If a matching container is found, it is used, and so a second one is not started. Otherwise, Dev Services for Kubernetes starts a new container.\n"
"The discovery uses the `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` label. The value is configured using the `service-name` property.\n"
"Container sharing is only used in dev mode."
msgstr "指示由 Quarkus Dev Services 管理的 Kubernetes 集群是否为共享集群。当为共享集群时，Quarkus 会通过基于标签的服务发现机制查找正在运行的容器。如果找到匹配的容器，则使用该容器，因此不会启动第二个容器。 否则，Dev Services for Kubernetes 将启动一个新的容器。服务发现使用 `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` 标签。该值通过 `service-name` 属性进行配置。容器共享仅在开发模式下使用。"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_KUBERNETES_CLIENT_DEVSERVICES_SHARED+++[]"
msgstr "环境变量：env_var_with_copy_button:QUARKUS_KUBERNETES_CLIENT_DEVSERVICES_SHARED[]"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-kubernetes-client_quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name]]`link:#quarkus-kubernetes-client_quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name[quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name]`\n"
"\n"
"[.description]\n"
"--\n"
"The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` label attached to the started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for Kubernetes looks for a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` label set to the configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` label set to the specified value.\n"
"This property is used when you need multiple shared Kubernetes clusters.\n"
"\n"
"Environment variable: env_var_with_copy_button:+++QUARKUS_KUBERNETES_CLIENT_DEVSERVICES_SERVICE_NAME+++[]\n"
"--"
msgstr "[lock] `link:#quarkus-kubernetes-client_quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name[quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid "icon:lock[title=Fixed at build time] [[quarkus-kubernetes-client_quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name]]`link:#quarkus-kubernetes-client_quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name[quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name]`"
msgstr "[lock] `link:#quarkus-kubernetes-client_quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name[quarkus.kubernetes-client.devservices.service-name]`"

#. mt: deepl
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` label attached to the started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for Kubernetes looks for a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` label set to the configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` label set to the specified value.\n"
"This property is used when you need multiple shared Kubernetes clusters."
msgstr "已启动容器上附加的 ` `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` ` 标签的值。当 ``shared`` 设置为 ` `true`` 时，将使用此属性。在此情况下，在启动容器之前，Dev Services for Kubernetes 会查找一个 ` `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` ` 标签值与配置值相同的容器。 如果找到，它将使用该容器，而不是启动一个新的容器。否则，它将启动一个新的容器，并将该容器的 ` `quarkus-dev-service-kubernetes` ` 标签设置为指定值。当您需要多个共享的 Kubernetes 集群时，会使用此属性。"

